thor_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.6 dev5, but it was already like that in previous versions.\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11\n\n### Issue description\nAccording to the Godot documentation and the engine source code, `METHOD_FLAG_STATIC` is defined as 32.\n\nHowever, when inspecting the script methods using `get_script_method_list()`, the static functions always return `33`. And in the method documentation, I didn't find any Enum with this value.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n```gdscript\nstatic func _check_static_methods(script: GDScript):\n\tfor f in script.get_script_method_list()\n\t\tif f.flags == METHOD_FLAG_STATIC: print(\"METHOD_FLAG_STATIC\")\n\t\tif f.flags == 33: print(\"33\")\n```","closed_by":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"u